    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "直到2016年才重新推出，",
      "traditional": "直到2016年才重新推出，",
      "pinyin": "zhí dào 4 nián cái chóng xīn tuī chū",
      "english": "Lotteria originally introduced this hamburger in 2013."
